From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jbevan <jbevan@bu.edu>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 18:44:27 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] Client: optional packet logger (--pktlog PATH)

Appends one JSON line per packet, both directions, to PATH: time, direction,
packet name and the raw bytes, plus the keys the client consumed (passwords
and other private prompts are muted). The connection's opening "conntype"
handshake is logged separately. Off unless --pktlog is given.

New file src/client/c-pktlog.c; hooks in net-client.c (send/receive),
client.c (option, init), c-util.c (key log) and c-externs.h.
